" style=\"color:#D6F9DD\">2025</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"py-[60px]\"><div class=\"max-w-[1120px] mx-auto px-5 md:px-[60px]\"><div class=\"grid gap-9 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_300px] items-start\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-7\"><div class=\"p-[30px] rounded-md\" style=\"background:var(--glass);border:1px solid var(--glass-border);backdrop-filter:blur(20px)\"><h3 class=\"font-bold mb-[18px] flex items-center gap-[10px]\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.25rem;color:#D6F9DD\">Challenges Faced</h3><div class=\"mb-5 last:mb-0\"><div class=\"text-[0.75rem] tracking-[0.06em] uppercase mb-[6px]\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono);color:#99F7AB\">Authentication Flow</div><div class=\"text-[0.9rem] leading-[1.75]\" style=\"color:rgba(214,249,221,0.62)\">Implementing JWT and Google OAuth simultaneously with Better Auth required careful session management and redirect logic to handle protected routes seamlessly.</div></div><div class=\"mb-5 last:mb-0\"><div class=\"text-[0.75rem] tracking-[0.06em] uppercase mb-[6px]\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono);color:#99F7AB\">Real-time UI Updates</div><div class=\"text-[0.9rem] leading-[1.75]\" style=\"color:rgba(214,249,221,0.62)\">Ensuring the dashboard reflected booking changes — update and delete — instantly without a page refresh required optimistic updates and careful state management.</div></div><div class=\"mb-5 last:mb-0\"><div class=\"text-[0.75rem] tracking-[0.06em] uppercase mb-[6px]\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono);color:#99F7AB\">Responsive Dashboard Layout</div><div class=\"text-[0.9rem] leading-[1.75]\" style=\"color:rgba(214,249,221,0.62)\">The multi-column dashboard with sidebar, bookings table, and profile sections needed careful CSS Grid design to remain usable on mobile devices.</div></div></div><div class=\"p-[30px] rounded-md\" style=\"background:var(--glass);border:1px solid var(--glass-border);backdrop-filter:blur(20px)\"><h3 class=\"font-bold mb-[18px]\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.25rem;color:#D6F9DD\">Future Improvements</h3><ul class=\"pl-5 space-y-2\"><li class=\"text-[0.93rem] leading-[1.8]\" style=\"color:rgba(214,249,221,0.62)\">Add doctor availability calendar with time-slot selection</li><li class=\"text-[0.93rem] leading-[1.8]\" style=\"color:rgba(214,249,221,0.62)\">Implement real-time notifications via WebSockets</li><li class=\"text-[0.93rem] leading-[1.8]\" style=\"color:rgba(214,249,221,0.62)\">Add payment gateway integration for premium bookings</li><li class=\"text-[0.93rem] leading-[1.8]\" style=\"color:rgba(214,249,221,0.62)\">Admin panel for managing doctors and appointments</li><li class=\"text-[0.93rem] leading-[1.8]\" style=\"color:rgba(214,249,221,0.62)\">Rating and review system for doctors post-appointment</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-[18px]\"><div class=\"p-[22px] rounded-[5px]\" style=\"background:var(--glass);border:1px solid var(--glass-border);backdrop-filter:blur(20px)\"><h4 class=\"text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] mb-[14px]\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono);color:rgba(214,249,221,0.32)\">Tech Stack</h4><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-[7px]\"><span class=\"sidebar-pill\">Next.js</span><span class=\"sidebar-pill\">Express.js</span><span class=\"sidebar-pill\">MongoDB</span><span class=\"sidebar-pill\">Tailwind CSS</span><span class=\"sidebar-pill\">DaisyUI</span><span class=\"sidebar-pill\">Better Auth</span><span class=\"sidebar-pill\">JWT</span><span class=\"sidebar-pill\">React Icons</span><span class=\"sidebar-pill\">React Toastify</span></div></div><div class=\"p-[22px] rounded-[5px]\" style=\"background:var(--glass);border:1px solid var(--glass-border);backdrop-filter:blur(20px)\"><h4 class=\"text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] mb-[14px]\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono);color:rgba(214,249,221,0.32)\">Key Features</h4><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-[9px]\"><div class=\"feature-item\">Multi-specialty doctor browsing and search</div><div class=\"feature-item\">Appointment booking with date and time selection</div><div class=\"feature-item\">JWT-secured authentication with Google OAuth</div><div class=\"feature-item\">Protected dashboard with full booking management</div><div class=\"feature-item\">User profile update — name and photo</div><div class=\"feature-item\">Toast notifications and loading states</div><div class=\"feature-item\">Custom 404 page</div><div class=\"feature-item\">Fully responsive across all devices</div></div></div><div class=\"p-[22px] rounded-[5px]\" style=\"background:var(--glass);border:1px solid var(--glass-border);backdrop-filter:blur(20px)\"><h4 class=\"text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] mb-[14px]\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono);color:rgba(214,249,221,0.32)\">Quick Links</h4><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-[9px]\"><a href=\"https://careloom-client.vercel.app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"flex items-center gap-[9px] px-[14px] py-[10px] rounded-[4px] text-[0.72rem] tracking-[0.04em] font-medium transition-opacity duration-200 hover:opacity-[0.88]\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono);background:#99F7AB;color:#111f26\">🌐 View Live Site ↗</a><a href=\"https://github.com/TanvirHassan-official/Careloom-client\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"flex items-center gap-[9px] px-[14px] py-[10px] rounded-[4px] text-[0.72rem] tracking-[0.04em] transition-all duration-200\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono);background:var(--glass);border:1px solid var(--glass-border);color:rgba(214,249,221,0.62)\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 496 512\" height=\"13\" width=\"13\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M165.9 397.4c0 2-2.3 3.6-5.2 3.6-3.3.3-5.6-1.3-5.6-3.6 0-2 2.3-3.6 5.2-3.6 3-.3 5.6 1.3 5.6 3.6zm-31.1-4.5c-.7 2 1.3 4.3 4.3 4.9 2.6 1 5.6 0 6.2-2s-1.3-4.3-4.3-5.2c-2.6-.7-5.5.3-6.2 2.3zm44.2-1.7c-2.9.7-4.9 2.6-4.6 4.9.3 2 2.9 3.3 5.9 2.6 2.9-.7 4.9-2.6